## 3.0.10 (2026-11-23)

Feature and usability improvements across OCR, translation, follow-up chat, service management,
and TTS plugin voice previews on top of 3.0.9.

本次在 3.0.9 的基礎上，針對文字辨識（OCR）、翻譯視窗、追問對話、服務設定管理，以及語音合成（TTS）外掛試聽帶來多項功能與體驗改進。

### New Features

- **Image-aware OCR follow-up chat** — OCR follow-up conversations now attach the captured
  image and carry it through subsequent turns. Follow-up chat can be started whenever an image
  is present even if no text was recognised, and text-only follow-up continues to work when
  only recognised text is available. Image input requires a vision-capable model and endpoint;
  failed requests display the error message.
  ([#7](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/7))

  **OCR 追問支援攜帶原圖** — OCR 追問對話會附上擷取的原圖，並在後續對話中持續保留。只要有原圖，即使沒有辨識出任何文字也能發起追問；若沒有圖片，已辨識的文字仍可用於純文字追問。圖片輸入需要所設定的模型與 API 端點支援，請求失敗時會顯示錯誤訊息。

- **Streamed OCR plugin output** — OCR plugins now display streamed results live during
  recognition, and abort in-flight requests cleanly when retrying or closing the window.
  (`7d76b15`)

  **OCR 外掛支援串流輸出顯示** — OCR 外掛在辨識過程中可即時顯示串流回傳內容，並支援於重試或關閉視窗時乾淨中止進行中的請求。

- **TTS plugin voice preview & one-click batch pre-fetch** — Added an in-settings voice
  preview panel for TTS plugins, featuring a default Taiwan Traditional Chinese sample
  sentence, a model-aware voice gallery covering all OpenAI and Gemini voices, instant
  in-memory replay caching, and rate-limited one-click batch pre-fetching ("一鍵全測") with
  mid-run cancellation.

  **語音合成（TTS）外掛設定頁新增語音預覽試聽與一鍵全測** — 內建台灣繁體中文預設試聽例句、依所選模型動態切換的聲音畫廊（涵蓋 OpenAI 與 Gemini 全部聲音）、記憶體快取即時重播，並支援限制並行數的一鍵全測批次預載與中途停止。

- **Temporary translation services for side-by-side comparison** — The translate window now
  supports adding temporary services to compare results without altering saved enabled or
  paused states. ([#12](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/12))

  **翻譯視窗支援臨時加開服務比對** — 可在翻譯視窗中臨時加入其他服務來對照譯文，不會更動原本已儲存的啟用或暫停狀態。

- **Auto-explain translations on chat open** — Opening a new follow-up chat from a
  translation automatically explains the source text and the selected service's translation.
  Subsequent turns retain the source text, translation, initial explanation, conversation
  history, and the selected service's settings.
  ([#13](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/13))

  **開啟翻譯追問時自動解說並保留完整上下文** — 新建翻譯對話時會自動解說原文與所選服務的譯文；後續追問會持續保留原文、譯文、初次解說與對話紀錄，並沿用所選服務的設定。

- **Duplicate service instance configurations** — Translation, OCR, TTS, and collection
  services can now duplicate an existing instance configuration, including its API endpoint
  and key. Click the copy button to the left of the delete button to create a copy
  immediately without a confirmation dialog.
  ([#10](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/10))

  **所有服務設定支援一鍵複製實例** — 翻譯、OCR、語音合成與收藏服務均支援複製既有的實例設定（包含 API 位址與金鑰）。複製按鈕位於刪除按鈕左側，點一下即可直接建立副本，不需額外確認。

### Improvements

- **Larger reading area for multiple OCR results** — Increased the display area height when
  viewing multiple OCR results side by side.
  ([#8](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/8))

  **擴大同時顯示多個 OCR 結果時的閱讀區域** — 提升多組 OCR 辨識結果同時呈現時的可視高度與閱讀空間。

- **Keyword filtering for the temporary OCR service menu** — The temporary OCR service picker
  now supports filtering by keyword while preserving the checked state of hidden entries.
  ([#9](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/9))

  **臨時 OCR 服務選單支援關鍵字篩選** — 選單新增關鍵字即時篩選功能，被隱藏的項目仍會保留原本的勾選狀態。

- **No forced auto-scroll during streaming translation** — Stopped automatically scrolling
  downward while translation output is being generated so readers keep their scroll position.
  ([#11](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/issues/11))

  **翻譯結果生成期間不再自動向下捲動** — 取消生成譯文時的強制自動捲動行為，方便在閱讀過程中停留在目前位置。

## 3.0.9 (2026-08-20)

A small bug-fix release on top of 3.0.8. For everything this fork adds over upstream
3.0.7, see the [3.0.8 release notes](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/releases/tag/3.0.8).

本次是在 3.0.8 之上的小型錯誤修正版。這個 fork 相對於上游 3.0.7 的完整變更，請見
[3.0.8 的發行說明](https://github.com/zeta987/pot-desktop/releases/tag/3.0.8)。

## Bug Fixes

- **The spinner no longer runs forever beside "Language not supported"** — switching to
  a language pair the service does not cover while a translation was still in flight
  stranded the panel's spinner: the superseded run is barred from touching the panel,
  and the unsupported branch never cleared the loading state. Turning a pair down now
  settles the spinner too, with a regression test covering the exact sequence. (`d9d0199`)

  **轉圈圈不再永遠掛在「Language not supported」旁邊** — 翻譯還在進行時切換到服務不支援
  的語言對，會讓面板的載入動畫變成孤兒：被作廢的舊翻譯依設計不准再碰面板，而「不支援
  該語言對」的分支又從來不清除載入狀態。現在拒絕語言對時也會一併熄掉載入動畫，並新增了
  重現這條路徑的回歸測試。

## Maintenance

- **`cargo fmt` over the chat window code** — formatting only, no behaviour change.
  (`c5827d7`)

  **對追問視窗的 Rust 程式碼執行 `cargo fmt`** — 純排版調整，行為完全不變。

## Notes

- This is a personal fork of `pot-app/pot-desktop`, not an official release. The version
  number continues upstream's sequence for clarity, nothing more.

  本版是 `pot-app/pot-desktop` 的個人 fork，並非官方發布。版本號碼沿用上游序列只是為了
  辨識方便。
